{"seq":1,"slug":"game-time-abstraction","title":"游戏时间抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/foundations/game-time-abstraction","wordCount":1643,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏时间抽象\">游戏时间抽象</h1><p>玩家在《集合啦！动物森友会》里抬头看到的是和现实同步的真实时间，在《星露谷物语》里看到的却是 0.7 现实秒等于 1 游戏分钟的压缩时间——这两种截然不同的体验，差别不在画面，而在游戏内部那条「时钟」是怎么定义的。把游戏时间从真实墙钟里独立出来、做成一个可被全局订阅的单一数据源，是整套昼夜系统的第一块、也是最容易被省略的一块地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏时间的本质，是一条只在「游戏逻辑认为时间应当流动时」才推进的标量轴。它绝不直接读取操作系统的 <code>DateTime.Now</code>：墙钟无法暂停、无法快进、无法在存档里冻结，而这三件事恰恰是玩法必需的。正确的做法是维护一个内部累加值，每帧用引擎给的帧间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 乘以当前缩放系数累加进去。</p>\n<p>下图描述了从硬件帧到游戏时钟、再到各订阅系统的单向数据流。关键在于：所有需要时间的系统都从同一个 <code>GameClock</code> 取值，而不是各自累加，这样暂停、快进、存档只需改一处。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[引擎主循环&lt;br/&gt;提供真实 deltaT] --&gt; B[GameClock.Tick&lt;br/&gt;realDt 乘 timeScale]&#10;    B --&gt; C[累加 totalGameMinutes]&#10;    C --&gt; D[派生只读量&lt;br/&gt;phase / hour / day]&#10;    D --&gt; E[昼夜渲染订阅]&#10;    D --&gt; F[NPC 日程订阅]&#10;    D --&gt; G[事件系统订阅]&#10;    D --&gt; H[季节生态订阅]\">flowchart TD\n    A[引擎主循环&lt;br/&gt;提供真实 deltaT] --&gt; B[GameClock.Tick&lt;br/&gt;realDt 乘 timeScale]\n    B --&gt; C[累加 totalGameMinutes]\n    C --&gt; D[派生只读量&lt;br/&gt;phase / hour / day]\n    D --&gt; E[昼夜渲染订阅]\n    D --&gt; F[NPC 日程订阅]\n    D --&gt; G[事件系统订阅]\n    D --&gt; H[季节生态订阅]</pre><p>把游戏时间与真实时间这两套时钟的属性摆在一起对比，就能看清为什么必须分家：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>真实墙钟 (DateTime.Now)</th>\n<th>游戏时钟 (GameClock)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推进来源</td>\n<td>操作系统 RTC</td>\n<td>主循环累加的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>timeScale</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\times \\text{timeScale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timeScale</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否暂停</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>能（timeScale 置 0 或 paused 标志）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否缩放</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>能（一天压缩到几分钟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否倒流</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>能（缩放系数取负，用于回放）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存档可序列化</td>\n<td>无意义</td>\n<td>是（核心字段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台一致</td>\n<td>受时区/夏令时干扰</td>\n<td>完全自定义、确定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tick-与游戏分钟-选择推进粒度\">tick 与游戏分钟：选择推进粒度</h2><p>时钟该以多细的粒度推进，是第一个工程决策。直接用浮点秒累加最自然，却会在长会话里累积浮点误差，也难以让 NPC「整点出门」这类逻辑判等。多数生活模拟游戏选择<strong>离散 tick</strong>：把游戏时间切成最小不可分的格子，例如 1 游戏分钟为一格，时钟内部存一个整数 <code>totalGameMinutes</code>，每当累加的现实时间够推进一格就触发一次 tick。</p>\n<p>离散化带来三个好处。其一，整数比较无精度问题，<code>if (clock.totalGameMinutes == targetMinute)</code> 永远可靠。其二，事件可以精确挂在「第 N 分钟」而不会因帧率漂移而错过。其三，存档只需存一个整数加一个不足一格的余量。代价是时间在视觉上是阶跃的——但对天体位置这类连续量，我们额外保留一个 0 到 1 的格内插值 <code>tickFraction</code>，渲染时用它平滑过渡。</p>\n<p>一个最小的离散时钟推进逻辑如下，它把现实毫秒折算成游戏分钟，整数部分触发 tick，小数部分留存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public sealed class GameClock {&#10;    public long TotalMinutes { get; private set; }&#10;    public float TickFraction { get; private set; } // 0..1 当前分钟内插值&#10;    public float TimeScale = 1f;&#10;    // 每现实秒推进多少游戏分钟（星露谷约 1/0.7 ≈ 1.43）&#10;    public float MinutesPerRealSecond = 1f / 0.7f;&#10;    private float _accum;&#10;&#10;    public void Advance(float realDt) {&#10;        _accum += realDt * MinutesPerRealSecond * TimeScale;&#10;        while (_accum &gt;= 1f) { _accum -= 1f; TotalMinutes++; OnMinute(); }&#10;        TickFraction = _accum; // 供渲染插值&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public sealed class GameClock {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public long TotalMinutes { get; private set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float TickFraction { get; private set; } // 0..1 当前分钟内插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float TimeScale = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 每现实秒推进多少游戏分钟（星露谷约 1/0.7 ≈ 1.43）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float MinutesPerRealSecond = 1f / 0.7f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float _accum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Advance(float realDt) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _accum += realDt * MinutesPerRealSecond * TimeScale;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (_accum >= 1f) { _accum -= 1f; TotalMinutes++; OnMinute(); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TickFraction = _accum; // 供渲染插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>TimeScale</code> 与 <code>MinutesPerRealSecond</code> 是两个正交旋钮：后者是设计层固定的「世界基准速度」，前者是运行时临时加速（玩家按住快进、过场加速）。把它们分开，调试时改一个不会污染另一个。关于缩放与暂停的完整语义，见 <a href=\"time-scaling-pausing\">时间缩放与暂停</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相位-交给下游的统一读数\">相位：交给下游的统一读数</h2><p><code>totalGameMinutes</code> 对渲染系统并不友好——太阳关心的不是「第 12345 分钟」，而是「今天过去了百分之多少」。因此时钟对外派生一个最重要的只读量：<strong>日内相位 (day phase)</strong>，一个把当天从午夜到午夜映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的标量。</p>\n<p>设一天有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 游戏分钟（地球式为 1440），当天已过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，则相位为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>phase</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>TotalMinutes</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{phase} = \\frac{m}{M} = \\frac{\\text{TotalMinutes} \\bmod M}{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">phase</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TotalMinutes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>相位是整座 hub 的通用货币。太阳高度角是相位的函数，天空颜色查表用相位作键，方向光旋转角正比于相位。把相位标准化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非小时数，好处是与「一天多长」解耦：哪怕某星球一天有 2000 分钟，下游公式一行都不用改。相位驱动太阳的具体方法见 <a href=\"../day-night/sun-moon-position\">日月轨迹</a>。</p>\n<p>需要区分相位与「绝对时间」：相位是周期性的循环量（每天归零），<code>totalGameMinutes</code> 是单调递增的绝对量。NPC 日程查的是绝对时间内的当日时刻，而长跨度倒计时（「三天后船到港」）查的是绝对分钟差。两者都从同一时钟派生，互不矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单一数据源与确定性\">单一数据源与确定性</h2><p>把时钟做成<strong>单一数据源 (single source of truth)</strong> 不是洁癖，而是为了三个硬需求。第一是暂停一致性：若每个系统各自累加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，暂停时漏改一个就会出现「太阳停了但作物还在长」的撕裂。第二是存档一致性：序列化只需存一个整数加一个余量，反序列化后全世界自动对齐；若时间散落各处，存档要逐个抢救。第三是确定性回放与联机：把时钟推进做成纯函数——给定相同的初始状态与相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 序列，必然得到相同的时间轴——回放与帧同步联机才可能复现。</p>\n<p>确定性有一个容易踩的坑：可变帧率下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 本身就因机器而异。需要严格确定的系统（联机、回放）应当让时钟推进绑定到固定步长而非可变帧，把渲染插值与逻辑推进分离。这一分离的工程细节见 <a href=\"time-scaling-pausing\">时间缩放与暂停</a> 的固定步长累加器一节，而它对存档的影响见 <a href=\"../practice/time-save-state\">时间状态存档</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>游戏时间必须与真实墙钟解耦，做成一个可暂停、可缩放、可序列化的内部时钟，而非直接读 <code>DateTime.Now</code>。</li>\n<li>推进粒度优先选离散 tick（整数 <code>totalGameMinutes</code>）保证判等可靠，另存 <code>tickFraction</code> 供渲染平滑插值。</li>\n<li>时钟对外派生 0 到 1 的<strong>日内相位</strong>作为下游统一货币，与「一天多长」彻底解耦。</li>\n<li>区分循环量（相位）与单调量（绝对分钟）：前者驱动昼夜渲染，后者驱动日程与长倒计时。</li>\n<li>坚持单一数据源换来暂停一致、存档简单、确定可回放三大收益，是后续所有章节的共同地基。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"time-scaling-pausing\">时间缩放与暂停</a> —— 时钟两个旋钮的完整语义；<a href=\"in-game-calendars\">游戏内日历</a> —— 分钟数如何向上折叠成日月季年；<a href=\"../day-night/sun-moon-position\">日月轨迹</a> —— 相位如何驱动太阳。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：游戏主循环与 <code>deltaTime</code> 的底层来源见 <a href=\"../../game-engine-fundamentals/\">游戏引擎基础</a>；确定性时钟在帧同步联机中的应用见 <a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/\">游戏回放与确定性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"游戏时间抽象","id":"游戏时间抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"tick 与游戏分钟：选择推进粒度","id":"tick-与游戏分钟-选择推进粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"相位：交给下游的统一读数","id":"相位-交给下游的统一读数"},{"level":2,"text":"单一数据源与确定性","id":"单一数据源与确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"时间缩放与暂停","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/foundations/time-scaling-pausing"}}